#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:28
msgid ""
"A free, fast community theme for BuddyPress, BuddyBoss and PeepSo with a "
"modern layout and dark mode."
msgstr ""
"Un tema community gratuito e veloce per BuddyPress, BuddyBoss e PeepSo con "
"un layout moderno e modalità scura."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:34
msgid ""
"The social network layer for WordPress, with feeds, member spaces, and "
"messaging."
msgstr ""
"Lo strato di social network per WordPress, con feed, spazi membri e "
"messaggistica."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:40
msgid "Self-moderating forums and Q&A boards that scale to huge topic counts."
msgstr ""
"Forum autogestiti e bacheche di domande e risposte che si adattano a enormi "
"quantità di argomenti."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:46
msgid "A photo and video community with albums, reactions, following, and DMs."
msgstr ""
"Una comunità di foto e video con album, reazioni, follow e messaggi privati."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:53
msgid "Run community events with RSVPs, calendars, and front-end submissions."
msgstr ""
"Gestisci gli eventi della community con RSVP, calendari e iscrizioni dal "
"frontend."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:60
msgid ""
"Reward members with points, badges, and leaderboards to keep engagement high."
msgstr ""
"Premia i membri con punti, badge e classifiche per mantenere alto "
"l'engagement."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:66
msgid "Build directories your members can search, review, map, and submit to."
msgstr ""
"Crea directory che i tuoi membri possono cercare, recensire, mappare e "
"compilare."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:73
msgid ""
"Add a job board with front-end listings, applications, and employer profiles."
msgstr ""
"Aggiungi una bacheca lavori con annunci dal frontend, candidature e profili "
"dei datori di lavoro."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:79
msgid ""
"Sell online courses with quizzes, payments, and completion certificates."
msgstr "Vendi corsi online con quiz, pagamenti e certificati di completamento."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:86
msgid ""
"A free service marketplace with vendor dashboards, an 11-status order flow, "
"and Stripe or PayPal built in."
msgstr ""
"Un marketplace di servizi gratuito con dashboard per i venditori, un flusso "
"ordini a 11 stati e Stripe o PayPal integrati."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:94
msgid "More Free Tools from Wbcom Designs"
msgstr "Altri strumenti gratuiti da Wbcom Designs"

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:95
msgid ""
"Job Manager brings hiring into member profiles. These free Wbcom Designs "
"plugins build out the rest of the community around those careers: the theme "
"and network itself, forums, media, events, gamification, directories, jobs, "
"courses, and services."
msgstr ""
"Job Manager porta il reclutamento nei profili dei membri. Questi plugin "
"gratuiti Wbcom Designs costruiscono il resto della comunità attorno a quelle "
"carriere: il tema e la rete stessa, forum, media, eventi, gamification, "
"directory, lavori, corsi e servizi."

#: includes/admin/views/discover.php:107
msgid "Get it free"
msgstr "Scaricalo gratuitamente"

